<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Disconnect the engine control computer connector A and the crankshaft position sensor connector.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the terminals of the engine control computer and the crankshaft position sensor vehicle side connectors. (see <xref label="Seep02" href="X39400000QV016D"/> for Terminals of ECU)</ptxt>
